        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by the conditional check in the `UserGroupInformation.getLoginUser()` method, which required both the presence of a token file location and that security was enabled. This restriction prevented the loading of token storage files when security was turned off, leading to broken functionality in MapReduce (MR) operations that relied on these tokens.

        Commit message:
        HADOOP-8725. MR is broken when security is off (daryn via
 bobby)

git-svn-id: https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/hadoop/common/trunk@1376929 13f79535-47bb-0310-9956-ffa450edef68  

